  "name": "delivery readiness",
  "definition": "A per-criterion projection that keeps requirement, plan and delivery coverage separate. Delivery requires current immutable claim/verification or integrated work evidence and no delivery or transitive dependency blockers. Work progress, Quality definitions, legacy test runs and execution artifacts do not prove delivery; readiness is not an approval verdict.",
